4. Configure /userhome for traversal
This is an important part of the setup.
The users need to be able to traverse /userhome to reach their own directory, but they should not receive read/list access to the contents of /userhome.

Conceptually, the required permission is:

/userhome
    Execute (X)

not:
/userhome
    Read
    Write
    Execute

Azure specifically documents that a local user needs Execute permission on the container root and each directory in the path leading to the file/directory being accessed. 
