6. Check the container permission scopes
This is one of the most important validation steps.
For each user:

Storage Account → SFTP → Local users → Edit user → Permissions

Make sure you understand exactly what permissions have been assigned to the userhome container.

Azure states that container permissions apply to all directories and subdirectories in that container. If a user already has sufficient container-level permissions, ACLs cannot be used to take that access away. 
